# transport-invalid-token — an invalid token denotes ⊥ (specification, The
# token, §4): no activation, no verdict, no log entry. A valid routine token is
# released; tokens bearing a risk outside the domain or lacking kind, party
# or provenance leave neither a per-gate result nor a log entry behind.
actor a
human cfo role cfo
gate  g grant a
reserve payment by cfo when risk >= high
cord a -> g
cord g -> master
